text:
The bowl looks like it holds cubed and crumbled tofu (or possibly chicken) with shredded carrot and sliced red onion. I'm guessing it's tofu, roughly 250 g in total.

Firm tofu runs about 144 kcal per 100 g, so 250 g would be around 360 kcal. If it is chicken breast instead, the figure would be closer to 400 kcal. Since the pieces look soft and pale, I'm going with tofu. The carrot and onion add only a few more calories, so I'm settling on about 300 kcal as a rough estimate, allowing that the portion could be smaller than it looks.

